msgid "Ship Today Notice:"
msgstr "Ship Today Notice:"

#: includes/class-wc-stn-checkout-blocks.php:418
msgid ""
"the block checkout has no \"Ship date\" block, so customers cannot choose a "
"ship date (orders are placed without it). Add the block inside the checkout "
"form in the checkout page editor."
msgstr ""
"der Block-Checkout hat keinen Block „Versandtermin“, Kunden können daher "
"keinen Versandtermin wählen (Bestellungen gehen ohne Termin durch). Füge den "
"Block im Editor der Kassenseite innerhalb des Checkout-Formulars hinzu."

